WEBVTT

00:37.457 --> 00:40.127
Is that Captain Levi?

00:40.207 --> 00:42.877
I don't know what happened,
but we're lucky it did.

00:42.957 --> 00:46.257
The biggest threat we faced
is lying in a bloody heap.

00:46.337 --> 00:48.467
We should put one
in his head, just in case.

00:48.547 --> 00:50.047
There's no need.

00:50.137 --> 00:53.387
He was caught in a Thunder Spear
explosion at point-blank range.

00:53.467 --> 00:55.347
It shredded his guts.

00:55.427 --> 00:58.437
Killed him instantly,
from what I can tell.

01:00.687 --> 01:02.477
Then give him to me.

01:04.687 --> 01:08.647
I wanna check his pulse
for myself, so hand him over.

01:12.197 --> 01:13.657
[JAEGERIST 76B]
Floch!

01:18.207 --> 01:20.787
What's happening to it?
Did it just die?

01:20.877 --> 01:22.377
That's not it.

01:22.457 --> 01:24.877
Their bodies don't suck in steam
like that when they disappear.

02:26.727 --> 02:27.477
[splash]

02:27.567 --> 02:29.317
[Gasps] They're escaping!

02:29.397 --> 02:31.147
[JAEGERIST 76B]
Shit!

02:31.237 --> 02:32.197
[JAEGERIST 76C]
After them!

02:32.277 --> 02:33.857
[JAEGERIST 76B]
They can't get away!

02:35.527 --> 02:39.327
Zeke. How did you
end up inside that Titan?

02:40.247 --> 02:41.917
[ZEKE]
Couldn't tell you.

02:45.497 --> 02:48.297
[ZEKE]
I saw a girl I didn't know

02:48.377 --> 02:51.547
sculpting the earth
to reform my body.

02:52.467 --> 02:56.297
[ZEKE] In that empty place,
all I could do was watch.

02:57.307 --> 03:00.477
[ZEKE] It felt like I had
been there for years.

03:00.557 --> 03:04.397
But also, like it was
over in an instant.

03:04.477 --> 03:06.187
I remember.

03:07.227 --> 03:09.897
Staring at the sky.

03:09.987 --> 03:12.397
Were those the Paths I saw?

03:12.487 --> 03:14.487
Have to ask,
the Survey Corps had

03:14.567 --> 03:16.987
30 scouts guarding
your location.

03:17.067 --> 03:20.037
I'm assuming you turned
them all into Titans,

03:20.117 --> 03:22.037
but where are they now?

03:22.117 --> 03:25.417
Gone. That's the long
and short of it.

03:25.497 --> 03:28.037
This means our biggest
obstacles are dealt with.

03:28.127 --> 03:30.497
No one's left to get in our way.

03:30.587 --> 03:31.917
Let's go.

03:34.677 --> 03:38.717
[ZEKE] All we can do now
is keep moving forward.

03:38.797 --> 03:39.887
Right, Eren?

03:39.967 --> 03:44.977
♪ Opening Song ♪

05:15.187 --> 05:20.197
[Roars]

05:21.367 --> 05:22.827
What the hell?

05:23.737 --> 05:30.327
I think it's beginning.
The Titans have started to move.

05:33.707 --> 05:36.167
Is that you, Galliard?

05:36.257 --> 05:38.667
Didn't quite get him,
but it was worth a shot.

05:38.757 --> 05:41.677
Wait, Pieck! You're not
actually a traitor?

05:41.757 --> 05:45.177
Gabi! You really thought
I'd sell out my comrades?

05:45.267 --> 05:47.727
Well, you said if we
kept fighting for Marley,

05:47.807 --> 05:48.807
then we'd end up
getting put down!

05:48.887 --> 05:50.147
Look up there.

05:53.977 --> 05:56.857
[PIECK]
I don't trust Marley one bit.

05:56.937 --> 05:59.237
Having said that,
I trust the comrades

05:59.317 --> 06:01.907
who've fought at
my side completely.

06:05.027 --> 06:06.787
[MAGATH]
There's the smoke signal.

06:06.867 --> 06:08.327
Pieck and Galliard
tracked him down

06:08.407 --> 06:11.167
and forced him out
into the open.

06:11.247 --> 06:13.417
The Founder is here.

06:15.587 --> 06:18.207
Let's pay him back for Liberio.

06:18.297 --> 06:20.837
I want that bastard dead!

06:36.647 --> 06:38.397
[MARLEYAN SOLDIER 76A]
Go, go, go!

06:45.407 --> 06:47.487
Hey. What now?

06:47.577 --> 06:50.457
Hey, Pieck? Wake up, Pieck!

06:52.617 --> 06:54.627
Porco!

06:57.627 --> 06:59.627
[BOTH scream]

06:59.707 --> 07:01.377
[PIECK]
That hurt!

07:07.007 --> 07:09.267
[yells]

07:29.237 --> 07:31.407
[EREN] I can't believe Marley
was desperate enough

07:31.497 --> 07:33.667
to try something like this.

07:33.747 --> 07:35.957
They're practically
coming in blind.

07:36.037 --> 07:38.917
Why would they put what's left
of their military at risk?

07:38.997 --> 07:42.257
[YELENA]
Eren! Can you hear me?

07:42.337 --> 07:44.797
Abandon your
Titan body immediately!

07:44.887 --> 07:46.507
We need to get you inside.

07:46.587 --> 07:49.467
Then you can escape underground
with the War Hammer's power!

07:49.557 --> 07:52.267
You'll be at a disadvantage
if you fight here!

08:02.187 --> 08:03.567
[YELENA]
Eren!

08:19.037 --> 08:23.377
[EREN]
Let's do this. Reiner.

08:27.257 --> 08:29.757
[EREN]
Of course, you're here.

08:29.847 --> 08:34.057
Who else could talk Marley into
doing something so stupid?

08:37.477 --> 08:39.607
[YELENA]
Mobilize all units!

08:41.147 --> 08:44.107
Hurry! Protect Eren!

08:46.397 --> 08:49.617
Eren. Why?

08:57.417 --> 09:02.127
[Roars]

09:04.627 --> 09:06.797
[Roars]

09:13.267 --> 09:14.347
[GABI gasps]

09:17.267 --> 09:20.687
[GABI]
Reiner! He really came for us!

09:25.397 --> 09:27.567
Pieck! I'm over here!

09:39.537 --> 09:40.627
Gabi!

09:44.337 --> 09:46.207
[GABI]
Commander Magath?

09:47.257 --> 09:48.547
Dammit all, Braun!

09:48.627 --> 09:51.087
Did I order you to
pursue the enemy?

09:51.177 --> 09:53.427
[GABI gasps]
I'm sorry, sir!

09:53.507 --> 09:55.007
What the hell's
the matter with you?

09:55.097 --> 09:56.307
[COLT]
Gabi!

09:57.977 --> 09:59.187
[GABI]
Colt!

09:59.267 --> 10:02.147
Why isn't Falco here?
Is he safe?

10:05.647 --> 10:07.277
[GABI]
He's alive.

10:07.357 --> 10:09.947
He should be in
that big building.

10:10.027 --> 10:12.567
He got some of Zeke's
spinal fluid in his mouth,

10:12.657 --> 10:14.027
so they're keeping
him locked up.

10:14.117 --> 10:16.447
[Gasps] You're
kidding me, right?

10:17.407 --> 10:18.997
[PIECK TITAN] He's being
detained along with roughly

10:19.077 --> 10:23.247
300 local soldiers who also
drank the spinal fluid.

10:23.337 --> 10:26.957
I counted about 500 free
enemy troops in the area,

10:27.047 --> 10:29.127
but I didn't see
any sign of Zeke.

10:29.217 --> 10:32.257
We couldn't wait around
after what Reiner told us.

10:32.337 --> 10:35.677
Is it possible that they could
activate the Founder's power?

10:35.757 --> 10:38.307
[PIECK TITAN] I'm not sure.
But I know this much.

10:38.387 --> 10:40.557
That power is the strongest
weapon they've got―

10:40.637 --> 10:42.597
the ace up their sleeve.

10:42.687 --> 10:45.397
There must be some reason
they haven't played it yet.

10:45.477 --> 10:48.317
So I'm guessing that there's
still something keeping Eren

10:48.397 --> 10:51.197
from using the
Founder's ability.

10:51.277 --> 10:54.527
And what's that?
Some condition he hasn't met?

10:54.617 --> 10:55.827
[GABI gasps]

10:58.327 --> 11:01.247
[GABI] Wait. "You now possess
the Founding Titan

11:01.327 --> 11:03.957
as well as a Titan
with royal blood."

11:04.917 --> 11:07.707
[GABI] I heard Zeke say those
exact words to the enemy

11:07.797 --> 11:09.797
on the airship
that attacked Marley!

11:09.877 --> 11:12.087
But what does that mean?
Royal blood?

11:12.167 --> 11:15.257
Wait, he couldn't have been
talking about himself, could he?

11:15.347 --> 11:18.217
His parents were part of
the Restorationist leadership.

11:18.307 --> 11:19.807
It's possible.

11:19.887 --> 11:21.557
[PIECK TITAN] He's always had
powers above and beyond

11:21.637 --> 11:23.597
what the Beast usually would.

11:23.687 --> 11:26.147
This might be the explanation.

11:26.227 --> 11:28.277
If it is, then Zeke's
absence could be

11:28.357 --> 11:31.397
what's keeping Eren from
using the Founder's power.

11:31.487 --> 11:34.777
We have to prevent the two
of them from making contact.

11:36.407 --> 11:38.117
Commander Magath. Reiner is―

11:38.197 --> 11:39.327
[MAGATH]
It's "General" now,

11:39.407 --> 11:41.947
and Marley's shield
won't break that easily.

11:42.037 --> 11:44.957
No, it isn't just
Marley anymore.

11:45.037 --> 11:46.747
He's shielding the entire world.

11:46.827 --> 11:49.707
We're humanity's final hope.

11:49.797 --> 11:51.717
Killing the Founder
won't solve this.

11:51.797 --> 11:54.217
It'll just kick the can
down the road.

11:54.297 --> 11:56.717
So instead, we'll have
a Warrior eat him,

11:56.797 --> 11:59.757
and bring an end to
two thousand years of hatred.

12:46.557 --> 12:48.517
Now I'll make you pay.

12:50.147 --> 12:52.977
[GALLIARD] For the way
you trampled my home!

12:56.647 --> 13:01.907
[REINER] Eren. You're no threat
to us on your own.

13:01.987 --> 13:03.827
This is the end for you.

13:03.907 --> 13:05.827
So give up already!

13:22.347 --> 13:24.017
[JAEGERIST 76F]
Go! Finish them!

13:24.097 --> 13:25.637
[JAEGERIST 76G]
We brought their favorite snack.

13:25.727 --> 13:28.017
Let's hit 'em with
the Thunder Spears!

13:33.317 --> 13:35.067
[SCOUTS gasp]

13:39.657 --> 13:40.407
No.

13:40.487 --> 13:41.947
The hell was that?

13:57.797 --> 13:59.587
Load another round, soldier!

13:59.677 --> 14:01.347
Yes, sir!

14:01.427 --> 14:03.047
Blew his brains clean out.

14:03.137 --> 14:05.347
We crippled the Attack Titan's
motor control, sir!

14:05.427 --> 14:07.887
Nice shot, Commander Magath.

14:07.977 --> 14:09.477
[MAGATH]
You mean, "General."

14:09.557 --> 14:10.847
Much as I hate to say it,

14:10.937 --> 14:13.767
that's just how far
the Marleyan army's fallen.

14:13.857 --> 14:17.607
Her top artilleryman is the only
one left to steer the ship.

14:20.777 --> 14:23.367
Dammit, the Armor and Jaw
are gonna get away!

14:28.997 --> 14:30.247
[JAEGERIST 76I]
Contact!

14:30.327 --> 14:32.747
[JAEGERIST 76J]
Up on the roofs!

14:32.827 --> 14:35.167
[JAEGERIST 76D]
We're outnumbered!

14:35.247 --> 14:37.837
[JAEGERIST 76E] It's fine,
we're faster. Flank 'em!

14:43.177 --> 14:44.757
[VOLUNTEER 76A]
No way.

14:44.847 --> 14:48.477
I thought the Marleyan officer
corps was nearly wiped out.

14:48.557 --> 14:51.347
How did they coordinate this
attack in less than a month?

14:51.437 --> 14:52.597
If this goes on...

14:52.687 --> 14:54.647
They're gonna capture
the Founder!

14:56.277 --> 14:59.277
[YELENA]
Eren. You're not like the rest.

14:59.357 --> 15:01.107
You never were.

15:02.527 --> 15:04.947
[YELENA]
You're special.

15:08.367 --> 15:10.367
[Roars]

15:20.257 --> 15:21.877
[MAGATH]
Let him wear himself out.

15:21.967 --> 15:23.587
The War Hammer's powerful,

15:23.677 --> 15:26.757
but its ability burns
a great deal of energy.

15:29.097 --> 15:31.887
[MAGATH] Don't forget.
Willy Tybur sacrificed himself

15:31.977 --> 15:35.017
to offer us a chance
to launch this assault.

15:35.097 --> 15:37.857
Remember the message
he died to deliver.

15:37.937 --> 15:41.737
At this point, the only hope for
humanity is another Helos.

15:41.817 --> 15:45.197
A hero to save our world.

15:46.777 --> 15:49.697
[REINER]
Come on, Eren. Give up.

16:01.507 --> 16:04.337
[Roars]

16:04.427 --> 16:07.217
You've lost this fight.

16:07.297 --> 16:09.927
[Screaming]

16:10.017 --> 16:13.517
[REINER] It's over,
we've suffered enough.

16:14.807 --> 16:18.687
We all have,
and that includes you.

16:18.767 --> 16:25.697
[ONYANKOPON panting]

16:25.777 --> 16:27.447
[JEAN]
Onyankopon?

16:27.527 --> 16:30.027
Hey! What the hell's going on?

16:30.117 --> 16:31.697
[ONYANKOPON] Marley launched
an attack on the island

16:31.787 --> 16:33.247
with their airship fleet.

16:33.327 --> 16:34.917
They've got 500 soldiers,

16:34.997 --> 16:38.077
plus the Armored,
Jaw, and Cart Titans.

16:38.167 --> 16:40.837
Eren's still out there
fighting them on his own.

16:40.917 --> 16:42.627
But he's struggling.

16:42.707 --> 16:44.677
He's not gonna last long.

16:45.757 --> 16:47.757
[ONYANKOPON] Marley is gonna
take the Founder!

16:47.837 --> 16:49.347
You have to help!

16:49.427 --> 16:52.677
Join us. Protect Eren!

16:52.767 --> 16:55.137
[CONNY]
Are you shitting me?

16:55.227 --> 16:57.097
We're not on the same side!

16:57.187 --> 16:58.597
This is your battle!

16:58.687 --> 17:00.647
You already betrayed us once.

17:00.727 --> 17:03.357
Why the hell would we
do as you say?

17:03.437 --> 17:05.237
I'm sorry! I never wanted this,

17:05.317 --> 17:06.897
but Yelena would've
put a bullet in my head

17:06.987 --> 17:08.617
if I hadn't gone along
with her plan!

17:08.697 --> 17:12.077
Huh? You think I wanna
hear your excuses?

17:12.157 --> 17:13.367
You've been acting
like our friend

17:13.447 --> 17:16.287
while you used that wine
to take over Paradis!

17:16.367 --> 17:17.617
I'm sick of it.

17:17.707 --> 17:20.127
I'm so sick of getting betrayed!

17:20.207 --> 17:22.207
Reiner. Bertholdt. Annie.

17:22.297 --> 17:23.207
You.

17:23.297 --> 17:24.917
Even Eren's betrayed us!

17:25.007 --> 17:26.507
I can't stand it!

17:26.587 --> 17:29.217
Why should we do
a damn thing for him, huh?

17:29.297 --> 17:30.797
Why should we
save him just so he can

17:30.887 --> 17:34.097
stop any of us from
ever having kids? Well?

17:34.177 --> 17:35.267
[ONYANKOPON]
Wait.

17:37.727 --> 17:40.727
I'd like to hear
him out, at least. 'Kay?

17:42.107 --> 17:46.447
[ONYANKOPON coughing]

17:49.987 --> 17:52.987
I had no idea that Yelena
was plotting any of this.

17:53.077 --> 17:55.537
The tainted wine or
the euthanization plan.

17:55.617 --> 17:57.367
None of the Volunteers
were told anything.

17:57.457 --> 17:58.327
Huh?!

17:58.417 --> 17:59.917
[NICOLO]
He's telling the truth.

17:59.997 --> 18:03.087
We never discussed the tainted
wine with the Volunteers.

18:03.167 --> 18:06.377
Yelena ordered us
not to mention it to them.

18:06.457 --> 18:07.757
[ONYANKOPON]
What's more.

18:07.837 --> 18:10.757
I don't want to see
the Eldian people euthanized!

18:10.837 --> 18:13.847
Our goal was to build a new
Paradis alongside all of you.

18:13.927 --> 18:16.467
To rise up and
beat Marley together!

18:16.557 --> 18:19.727
That's why we left everything
behind to come here!

18:19.807 --> 18:23.437
I gave up my whole life for
the people of this island.

18:23.517 --> 18:24.477
Because...

18:24.567 --> 18:25.687
I thought together,
we could create

18:25.777 --> 18:27.947
a better future on Paradis.

18:28.027 --> 18:30.197
But there is no future
without children!

18:30.277 --> 18:32.617
If this euthanization
plan succeeds,

18:32.697 --> 18:34.487
then everything
we've sacrificed―

18:34.577 --> 18:36.447
It'll all be for nothing!

18:40.667 --> 18:42.917
You have to believe me.

18:46.547 --> 18:47.707
He's telling the truth.

18:47.797 --> 18:49.217
Armin?

18:49.297 --> 18:51.757
Years ago, when you
first came here,

18:51.837 --> 18:53.587
you said something
that stuck with me.

18:53.677 --> 18:57.177
That we Subjects of Ymir
exist because we're wanted.

18:57.257 --> 18:58.387
That the world
is more interesting

18:58.477 --> 19:00.597
with different kinds of people.

19:00.687 --> 19:02.137
I think you believe that.

19:02.227 --> 19:05.227
And I think that belief goes
against everything Zeke's doing.

19:05.317 --> 19:07.987
You meant all the things
you said, right?

19:08.067 --> 19:11.237
Then get back on
your feet. Onyankopon.

19:11.317 --> 19:12.697
Thank you.

19:15.197 --> 19:17.617
Well, for what it's worth,
I believe you, too.

19:17.697 --> 19:19.117
But now what?

19:19.197 --> 19:21.577
If we help Eren and Zeke
fight off the Marleyan army,

19:21.667 --> 19:22.827
they'll just end up
going through with

19:22.917 --> 19:25.127
the euthanization plan, right?

19:25.207 --> 19:28.087
Well. We'll at least have
a chance to stop them.

19:28.957 --> 19:31.087
Because if those two die,

19:31.167 --> 19:33.387
the whole world is gonna
come crashing down on us.

19:33.467 --> 19:35.507
[CONNY] So what are you trying
to say we should do, then?

19:35.597 --> 19:37.387
If nothing else, we can
activate the rumbling

19:37.467 --> 19:40.307
and show the world that we're
capable of punching back!

19:40.387 --> 19:43.267
[CONNY] Huh? You wanna give 'em
a taste of the rumbling?

19:43.347 --> 19:46.107
Hey, Mikasa, what do you think?

19:46.187 --> 19:48.107
Do you want to go help Eren?

19:53.737 --> 19:59.487
I would say yes. Except, knowing what he told me,

19:59.577 --> 20:04.707
I'm not sure if I want to or if
my blood is telling me to.

20:06.077 --> 20:08.167
[MIKASA]
I'm an Ackerman.

20:08.247 --> 20:10.547
My will's not my own.

20:10.627 --> 20:12.167
Huh?

20:12.257 --> 20:13.797
Look, Mikasa.

20:13.877 --> 20:16.797
I think Eren made that up
to mess with your head.

20:17.757 --> 20:19.467
No, he was on to something.

20:19.557 --> 20:22.267
He asked if I get
headaches, and I do.

20:22.347 --> 20:24.437
What makes you
think he was lying?

20:24.517 --> 20:26.097
What makes me think h―

20:26.187 --> 20:27.607
Guys.

20:27.687 --> 20:29.397
Do you actually
believe Eren wants to

20:29.477 --> 20:31.817
stop all Eldians
from having children?

20:31.897 --> 20:34.607
You honestly think
he'd go along with that?

20:39.027 --> 20:41.367
It doesn't really strike me
as something Eren would want,

20:41.447 --> 20:43.747
but I can't say that it's
more than he's willing―

20:43.827 --> 20:45.077
Well I can say it!

20:45.157 --> 20:46.457
He would never do that!

20:46.537 --> 20:47.707
You don't think so?

20:47.787 --> 20:49.537
Did you think he'd work
with Zeke and Yelena?

20:49.627 --> 20:51.917
He's just pretending to!
Don't you see?

20:51.997 --> 20:53.967
Eren's the one with
the Founding Titan's power,

20:54.047 --> 20:56.297
so he doesn't
need to fight Zeke!

20:56.387 --> 20:57.507
Things were different
when Yelena

20:57.587 --> 20:59.047
first came to him with the plan.

20:59.137 --> 21:00.547
There's no telling
what she might have done

21:00.637 --> 21:02.427
if he had refused to join her.

21:02.517 --> 21:04.807
He didn't have
any options back then!

21:04.887 --> 21:06.937
But now, Eren has Yelena
completely convinced

21:07.017 --> 21:08.767
that he's on her side,
and the Volunteers have

21:08.847 --> 21:11.277
gotten him in contact with Zeke.

21:11.357 --> 21:12.647
He's in control.

21:12.727 --> 21:15.527
He can use the rumbling
to protect the island!

21:15.607 --> 21:19.987
Nobody will dare lay a hand on
Paradis for the next 50 years!

21:34.457 --> 21:40.797
[Screaming]

21:50.187 --> 21:56.777
[EREN TITAN screaming]

22:01.947 --> 22:06.957
[Screaming]

22:09.957 --> 22:14.957
♪ Ending Song ♪

23:41.627 --> 23:44.797
[NARRATOR] The earth trembles
as the Titans clash.

23:44.887 --> 23:46.717
While their fight rages above,

23:46.807 --> 23:48.887
the people at their feet
must take up arms

23:48.967 --> 23:52.177
and charge into the fray,
like it or not.

23:52.267 --> 23:54.937
Next episode: "Sneak Attack."
